WEBVTT

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:08.260
Hi, this is Dr. Jelena Trajkovic from Cal State Long Beach, CECS Department. In this video,

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:15.100
we are going to learn how to create a project in Vivado, more about software versions of

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:21.460
Vivado and how to access it, you can find on the beach board. The video is originally

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:28.660
created for our course, CECS 201, but it can be used as a refresher anytime during

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:34.660
the course and in any other courses. So to create a new project, we are going to select

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:42.980
on Quick Start menu, create new project and press. We are going to move on to next and

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:49.620
we are going to enter project name. It is going to be lab 1, v2, this is my second

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:57.140
version of the same lab. And we are going to specify create project directory here,

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:00.980
which is going to make a subdirectory with project name,

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:04.660
the same name as the project name under the lab1 folder.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:09.260
We are going to use RTL project,

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:13.260
so that's why we check the top button.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.900
And we do not want to specify the sources.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.940
Again, we check do not specify option here.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:24.100
Once this is done, we need to select appropriate board.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.580
Even though first lab is not going to be using any boards,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.340
we are going to select the board

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:33.300
that we are going to work with in this class,

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:37.900
and that is going to be Nexus A7-100T.

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:40.940
Once this is selected, we just go to Finish,

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:45.620
check if everything is up to our selection,

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:47.380
and press Finish.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:50.820
In this moment, the project is going to be generated.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:55.540
In order to keep these videos short, we will stop here.

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.980
And in the next video, we will learn how to add sources.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.780
Thank you for watching.

